<html><head><title>How</title>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><div style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px; color: windowtext"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Paths to Transdisciplinary Education for Researchers</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px; color: windowtext"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Researchers can primarily </span><span style="margin: 0px">participate</span><span style="margin: 0px"> in transdisciplinary education in two ways: as initiators or by joining an existing project.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px; color: windowtext"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Much transdisciplinary education arises from enthusiastic researchers—sometimes, but not always, also working as teachers—seeking collaboration with educational and societal partners. These researchers act as pioneers: they </span><span style="margin: 0px">make a plan</span><span style="margin: 0px">, find like-minded enthusiasts, and try to gain support within their institution.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></div></body></html>